<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 你写哪类程序</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>当你的产物本身是 agent，边界由谁定</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{height: 250, flexDirection: "row", gap: 14, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 26, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>写传统程序时</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 27, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 12}}>那一圈是工具的一部分</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>用就好，改不动也没关系。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 64, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 32, color: "#0F6E56"}}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 26, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56"}}>写智能体时</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 27, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 12}}>那一圈是产品的一部分</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>边界由谁定，就由谁承担。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", marginTop: 34}}><Text style={{fontSize: 27, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, textAlign: "center"}}>你不能把产品的运行边界，外包给你写代码时用的那个工具。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.5, textAlign: "center", marginTop: 16}}>所以：造 agent 的 harness，最好在你自己手上。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>28 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
